1
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:52,759
Mr. Zhao,

2
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:53,759
How about

3
00:00:54,119 --> 00:00:55,119
I grab some guys right now

4
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:56,320
and break his leg at his place?

5
00:00:56,439 --> 00:00:58,000
I bet he'll cough up the house then!

6
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,520
Are you an idiot?

7
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:02,320
I just told you to avoid conflict.

8
00:01:03,159 --> 00:01:04,319
Going after him in broad daylight

9
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:06,200
is walking right into their crosshairs!

10
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,040
Right, right, right.

11
00:01:08,159 --> 00:01:09,200
You're completely right, Mr. Zhao.

12
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,400
My mistake.

13
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:10,920
Come here.

14
00:01:11,159 --> 00:01:11,760
Mr. Zhao?

15
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:18,840
Go pay him a visit.

16
00:01:19,719 --> 00:01:21,000
Offer a little more money.

17
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:22,159
Just remember,

18
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:24,719
play dirty in the shadows.

19
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:28,200
Don't tip off Yunding.

20
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,599
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

21
00:01:29,879 --> 00:01:30,439
When it comes to

22
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:32,439
a clueless, broke punk like him,

23
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,560
cash is king!

24
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:41,359
Mr. Zhao...

25
00:01:42,879 --> 00:01:43,400
Mr. Zhao,

26
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,280
I'll head out and handle it.

27
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,280
Go, get on with it.

28
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,280
Mr. Zhao,

29
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,719
here's what you asked for—

30
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:55,400
the price quotes for the North City project.

31
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,680
I've put it all together for you.

32
00:01:59,040 --> 00:01:59,920
Qianqian,

33
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,439
working overtime this late?

34
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,120
Thanks for your hard work.

35
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:08,039
Lightening your load, Mr. Zhao,

36
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:09,240
is my honor.

37
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:17,199
If there's nothing else,

38
00:02:17,719 --> 00:02:18,879
I'll head out now.

39
00:02:30,479 --> 00:02:31,759
Still putting on airs, huh?

40
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,039
Come on, Sister Yiyi.

41
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,199
Take a look for yourself.

42
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,680
These are my pride and joy.

43
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:48,439
In those big malls down south,

44
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:49,840
they'd fly off the shelves.

45
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:53,840
These clothes of yours are pretty avant-garde.

46
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,919
Avant-garde?

47
00:02:55,199 --> 00:02:56,400
They're downright gorgeous!

48
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:57,599
They look good on anyone.

49
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:58,919
If we use these to cover the interest,

50
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,039
you definitely won't lose out.

51
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:01,800
Whether they can cover the interest,

52
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,039
I'll have to try them on first.

53
00:03:48,879 --> 00:03:50,120
No exaggeration,

54
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:52,280
this outfit looks stunning on you.

55
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,599
Save the sweet talk.

56
00:03:54,919 --> 00:03:56,360
It's because I'm naturally gorgeous.

57
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,639
I look good in anything.

58
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,599
Pair it with this.

59
00:04:37,399 --> 00:04:38,800
These pants...

60
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:41,480
They really make your legs look so long!

61
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:44,199
That's the point—legs all the way up!

62
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:49,839
And what style is this?

63
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,839
Try it on and see.

64
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:19,160
What are you looking at?

65
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:20,120
Close your eyes.

66
00:05:22,759 --> 00:05:25,399
Why does the slit in this skirt...

67
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:28,319
look like the tree branch from that night?

68
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,120
You!

69
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:33,519
How dare you bring up that night!

70
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:34,600
Don't say another word!

71
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,600
That night in the tree...

72
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,319
you were just...

73
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:37,040
hanging there like that.

74
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:38,160
What are you doing?

75
00:05:39,279 --> 00:05:40,079
Ma Dawei!

76
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:40,879
Let go of me!

77
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:42,360
The final payment for that printed fabric—

78
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:45,959
Ma Dawei!

79
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:48,160
I knew you were no good!

80
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:49,160
Fooling around with women...

81
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,839
and you brought her into the factory?!

82
00:05:51,079 --> 00:05:52,519
You're dirtying up my place!

83
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:53,360
What the hell?

84
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,399
I'm selling clothes here!

85
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,920
This is my VIP client!

86
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:56,519
Stop making a scene!

87
00:05:56,519 --> 00:05:57,199
Get out, get out!

88
00:06:00,639 --> 00:06:01,759
You're cheating on me!

89
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:02,639
Shameless!

90
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,759
I'm going to tell my dad right now!

91
00:06:05,079 --> 00:06:07,399
I'll have you thrown out of here today!

92
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,240
Still the same old temper.

93
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:13,079
Your girlfriend?

94
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:14,240
What?

95
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:15,439
Dong Nan?

96
00:06:15,839 --> 00:06:17,160
She's the deputy director of this factory.

97
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,680
Whatever, forget about her.

98
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,160
What do you think of this outfit?

99
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:20,920
It's alright, I guess.

100
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,879
The design is pretty good,

101
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:24,959
but as for the fabric...

102
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:26,199
it's way too rough.

103
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,040
You went to all this trouble

104
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,519
to design such nice clothes,

105
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:30,519
but how much can you actually sell them for?

106
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,360
Don't forget,

107
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,120
you still owe me over two million.

108
00:06:34,399 --> 00:06:36,480
Are you going to sell this cheap junk

109
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,920
and pay me back in your next life?

110
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,000
That shows what you know.

111
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,480
Jinhua Factory is about to go bankrupt.

112
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,560
This pile of unsellable, outdated fabric,

113
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,480
nobody wants it even if sold by the pound.

114
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,000
I'll buy out the lot from the director.

115
00:06:46,399 --> 00:06:48,360
Factoring in labor and utility costs,

116
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,319
making a single garment

117
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:50,639
costs less than ten yuan at most.

118
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,600
Less than ten yuan?

119
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,120
Then how much do you plan to sell it for?

120
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,000
If anyone else sold it,

121
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,000
20 at most.

122
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:58,079
But designed by Ma Dawei,

123
00:06:58,079 --> 00:06:59,920
placed in the prime night market district,

124
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:02,639
labeled latest HK-Taiwan hot girl style,

125
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,199
I can sell each for 88,

126
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:05,120
and people will fight to buy them!

127
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:08,120
Nearly ten times the profit.

128
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:08,800
Exactly.

129
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:09,920
A tenfold return.

130
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,519
And that's just step one.

131
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:12,959
Once our name gets out there,

132
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,680
we'll switch to top-grade fabrics

133
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,720
and get into luxury counters.

134
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:17,319
By then, it'll be tens of times,

135
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:18,279
even a hundredfold!

136
00:07:18,319 --> 00:07:19,120
Two million?

137
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,199
Won't be a problem at all.

138
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,079
This guy...

139
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,639
Not only does he have a sharp eye,

140
00:07:24,639 --> 00:07:26,000
he's also incredibly bold.

141
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,040
His business acumen

142
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,839
is even ahead of those highly paid

143
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:31,839
traders hired by Yunding.

144
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:36,319
Then again,

145
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:38,120
without my permission,

146
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,480
you swiped over two million from me.

147
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,639
Doesn't that count as extortion?

148
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,800
Well, I don't have any cash right now.

149
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:47,680
Fine.

150
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,720
Then let's consider my money

151
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,120
an investment in your clothing business.

152
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,519
We split the profits fifty-fifty.

153
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:52,279
Half?

154
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,680
I only hold 40 percent!

155
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,720
How can I give you half?

156
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,759
Then I want 20 percent.

157
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:56,639
Twenty?!

158
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,079
Why don't you just rob a bank?

159
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,120
You disagree?

160
00:07:59,240 --> 00:07:59,759
Alright then.

161
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,120
Guess I'll just have to call the police.

162
00:08:04,879 --> 00:08:05,560
My bad.

163
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,800
I give up.

164
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,040
Deal.

165
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:09,680
Done.

166
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:10,920
From now on,

167
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,439
we're officially partners.

168
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,439
As for these clothes,

169
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:14,120
I'll take them back with me

170
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,600
to thoroughly inspect their quality,

171
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,720
so they don't tarnish my investment.

172
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:23,439
You just want to sneak them for yourself.

173
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,879
Women...

174
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,040
No matter how tough they talk,

175
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:28,160
they can't resist beautiful clothes.

176
00:08:32,759 --> 00:08:33,559
Forgot to get her number.
